# TS1_2_to_PS1_2b
# TS1.2 (step_1_2_RS.pdb)  ->  PS1.2b (step_1_2_PS.pdb)
# Two-water proton redistribution from ammonium/alkoxide to neutral carbinolamine plus W1 hydronium / W2 hydroxide.
#
# q atom (q)         PDB ID          LIB ID (resname.name)
# or neighbour (n)?  (resid.atom)    TS1.2          PS1.2b        
#
# STATE-ALIAS MODE: make sure your .lib residue names match these aliases.
# Component aliases:
#   ACE: T12A -> P12A
#   ENL: T12E -> P12E
#   NME: T12N -> P12N
#   PAF: T12P -> P12P
#   WA2: T122 -> P122
#   WAT: T12W -> P12W
#
q                   1.N2            T12P.N2          P12P.N2          # serial 1 PAF A1.N2
q                   1.C9            T12P.C9          P12P.C9          # serial 2 PAF A1.C9
q                   1.C7            T12P.C7          P12P.C7          # serial 3 PAF A1.C7
q                   1.C4            T12P.C4          P12P.C4          # serial 4 PAF A1.C4
